<title>HONG KONG: Victory City places 40 mln new shares.</title>
<headline>Victory City places 40 mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textile maker Victory City International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had agreed to place 40 million new shares, or 16.67 percent of its enlarged share capital, to individual investors at HK$0.55 per share.</p>
<p>The placement is expected to be completed on May 5, it said.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of about HK$21.5 million will be used to repay short-term bank loans and to buy machinery, it said.</p>
<p>Victory City shares were up HK$0.14 at HK$0.72 just before the midday break.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
